weet_count":0},"text":"哈哈，谢谢兄弟。 https://t.co/tQ8UhEMGiL","url":"https://x.com/wangwatchworld/status/2115252745498485191"},{"author_id":"28940967","created_at":"2026-10-28T01:20:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115252299450798374"],"id":"2115252299450798374","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":43,"impression_count":34819,"like_count":90,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":34,"retweet_count":8},"text":"我很确定的一点是，做SAT solver的人，将会是第一波直接吃到OpenAI昨天发布的证伪ETH的工作的人。\n\n我预感世界上有四波人正在下手，一个是cadence，一个是synopsys，一个是我，一个是欧洲某个长期做SAT solver的组。\n\n如果人们在商用SAT solver上获得了极大提升，半导体行业将会是第一个吃红利的产业。 https://t.co/EAzJ9GpJf2","url":"https://x.com/lidangzzz/status/2115252299450798374"},{"author_id":"31083308","created_at":"2026-10-28T01:19:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115252199970459844"],"id":"2115252199970459844","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":8513,"like_count":32,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":0},"text":"其实并没有仇恨。\n多数中国人只是口嗨。\n在遇到来华的西方人时照样很热情的招待。 https://t.co/wwSwRHM5h3","url":"https://x.com/wangwatchworld/status/2115252199970459844"},{"author_id":"50683","created_at":"2026-10-28T01:19:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115252195637797192"],"id":"2115252195637797192","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":44,"impression_count":8047,"like_count":62,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":3},"text":"前几天拿到测试的这个 Linux 系统正式对外开放了！看看这 demo 和网站， 设计品味明显比 Omarchy 好很多啊，建议手里有闲置 PC 的朋友下载尝试一下。\n\nhttps://t.co/8nzTDNegMj https://t.co/lJaiCijf4b","url":"https://x.com/dingyi/status/2115252195637797192"},{"author_id":"51904755","created_at":"2026-10-28T01:17:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115251563791036635"],"id":"2115251563791036635","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":50,"impression_count":8277,"like_count":110,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":17},"text":"婚姻从来不是人生完整的前提。一个人是否完整，取决于他能否独立认识自己、建立生活秩序，并自主决定人生方向，而不取决于是否拥有伴侣或婚姻。婚姻可以丰富人生，却不能替代自我建立。把婚姻当作人生的必需品，人就容易为了结婚而选择伴侣，为了维持关系而牺牲自我，最终把一种本应自主选择的生活方式","url":"https://x.com/Morris_LT/status/2115251563791036635"},{"author_id":"55964567","created_at":"2026-10-28T01:16:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115251410912870848"],"id":"2115251410912870848","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2347,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"广而告之 https://t.co/mIQzLw8Kt5","url":"https://x.com/wuzuolai/status/2115251410912870848"},{"author_id":"31083308","created_at":"2026-10-28T01:13:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115250646706446662"],"id":"2115250646706446662","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":26,"impression_count":42409,"like_count":351,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":51,"retweet_count":6},"text":"曼谷的两名中国老板因拒付工资与四名缅甸籍劳工起纠纷，一人被杀，一人重伤。\n我想跟各位在泰国的老板说的是，缅甸劳工工资不高，停发工资会真的饿肚子，也会真的杀人，别把在国内的习惯带过来。","url":"https://x.com/wangwatchworld/status/2115250646706446662"},{"author_id":"3319804777","created_at":"2026-10-28T01:08:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115249352491049020"],"id":"2115249352491049020","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":4440,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":2},"text":"奥运冠军喊你一起来锻炼身体啦～这几个动作×50次，越练越有劲儿。 https://t.co/WLTJh5NkZ1","url":"https://x.com/XinhuaChinese/status/2115249352491049020"},{"author_id":"51904755","created_at":"2026-10-28T01:06:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115248860197208557"],"id":"2115248860197208557","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":82,"impression_count":24176,"like_count":289,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":36,"retweet_count":20},"text":"群友问我，如何看待\"姆巴佩\"的事件？我说：姆巴佩，是说了在自己所在的环境下，部分主流舆论认可的内容，但说得不够委婉，踩中了另一个政治环境的敏感点。我从不同的角度说下：\n\n从历史的角度：不同环境下的人，对同一个历史人物有不同评价，是很正常的。 https://t.co/iAIZONkdeR","url":"https://x.com/Morris_LT/status/2115248860197208557"},{"author_id":"1531801543","created_at":"2026-10-28T01:00:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115247178667233393"],"id":"2115247178667233393","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3022,"like_count":14,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":2},"text":"【科學家發現遠古兩棲動物新物種】貴州省地質博物館聯合北京大學、美國加州大學戴維斯分校學者組成的國際合作研究團隊，基於在貴州關嶺縣晚三疊世地層中發現的兩件近乎完整的骨骼化石，發現距今約2.37億年的兩棲動物新物種——海異螈。相關成果於北京時間10月27日在線發表於國際學術期刊《自然-生態與演 https://t.co/O0kWtdObsY","url":"https://x.com/PDChinese/status/2115247178667233393"},{"author_id":"855303666722525184","created_at":"2026-10-28T00:56:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115246177595928724"],"id":"2115246177595928724","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":7455,"like_count":25,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":0},"text":"都说 AI 短剧点一下就成，真去问成本，个个都是花了小几十万到上百万的主。\n\n1. 10 分钟一集，差不多 50 万\n2. 30 分钟短剧，6 个月烧了 250 万左右\n3. 说好的轻松躺赚，结果亏钱的人反而更多\n\n视频 AI 一次出不来想要的镜头，重新生成的钱最烧。\n\n想当副业干，先把 10 分钟一集的账算明白再说。 https://t.co/VwsjojUSY0","url":"https://x.com/wanerfu/status/2115246177595928724"},{"author_id":"1531801543","created_at":"2026-10-28T00:38:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115241811648381408"],"id":"2115241811648381408","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2965,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"【“深海一號”船攜“蛟龍”號訪問瑙魯】當地時間10月26日，正在進行中國大洋100航次第二航段科學考察的“深海一號”船在瑙魯艾沃港靠泊，舉辦以“凝聚‘認識海洋、保護海洋’共識”為主題的開放日活動，這也是中國科考船首次在瑙魯舉辦開放日活動。 https://t.co/GMrJIKmjma","url":"https://x.com/PDChinese/status/2115241811648381408"},{"author_id":"55964567","created_at":"2026-10-28T00:38:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115241693863981301"],"id":"2115241693863981301","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":6795,"like_count":21,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":2},"text":"江泽民：我不是独裁者，只是偶尔独裁…… https://t.co/K8kKOphcet https://t.co/cGRhsrWULv","url":"https://x.com/wuzuolai/status/2115241693863981301"},{"author_id":"1456122926432862223","created_at":"2026-10-28T00:21:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115237556828979441"],"id":"2115237556828979441","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impressio